{"id":"636138","name":"银耳汤圆","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/636138/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲜银耳","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"汤圆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜的银耳清洗干净备用。","img":"images/636138/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"适量红枣洗净备用。","img":"images/636138/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将银耳剪碎放入砂锅中。","img":"images/636138/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/636138/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大火煮开。","img":"images/636138/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入红枣，盖上盖子小火煲15分钟左右。","img":"images/636138/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煲至银耳出胶。","img":"images/636138/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入汤圆。","img":"images/636138/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮至汤圆浮起即可。","img":"images/636138/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636138/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636138/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636138/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636138/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}